  "title": "RYANAIR MARKS 7 MILLION PASSENGERS THROUGH BELFAST INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT",
  "summary": "Ryanair, Europe’s No.1 airline, today (29 Jul) announced that it has carried over 7m passengers through Belfast International Airport since it began operations to/from the airport a decade ago. This summer, Ryanair is operating 166 weekly flights across 15 routes to/from Belfast International Airport, including popular sun hotspots like Alicante, Lanzarote and Malta, as well as top city break destinations like Krakow, Milan and Porto. To celebrate this significant milestone, Ryanair has launched a limited-time […]",
